  "term": "alprazolam",
  "definition": "Alprazolam is a triazolobenzodiazepine medication with anxiety-reducing and sedative-hypnotic effects. It is used in mental health care for panic disorder, including when agoraphobia is present, and for generalized anxiety disorder.",
